  "description_short": "Lively cocktail bar in Mossel Bay's harbour area serving creative drinks and light meals with a relaxed coastal vibe.",
  "description_long": "Tucked into Mossel Bay's historic harbour district on Market Street, Blue Oyster Cocktail Bar has carved out a reputation as the town's go-to spot for inventive drinks and good times. The bar's skilled mixologists shake up everything from classic cocktails to creative house specialties, while the relaxed atmosphere makes it easy to settle in for the evening.\n\nThe menu covers light meals and bar snacks that pair well with the drinks list, and the location near the waterfront means you're steps away from Mossel Bay's working harbour and maritime heritage. Whether you're looking for sundowners after a beach day or a proper night out, the crowd here tends to be a friendly mix of locals and visitors who appreciate a well-made drink.\n\nWith its central location and late hours, Blue Oyster fits perfectly into a Mossel Bay evening—start with dinner elsewhere in town, then head here for cocktails and the kind of easy-going coastal hospitality that keeps people coming back.",
